{
 "s1": [
  {
   "idx": 0,
   "text": "I asked an AI to build me a magic system.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.9,
    "style": 0.45,
    "stability": 0.5,
    "pause_after": 0.35,
    "tag": "open"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s00.mp3",
   "duration": 2.72,
   "cost_usd": 0.0123,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 1,
   "text": "Just for fun.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s01.mp3",
   "duration": 1.6,
   "cost_usd": 0.0039,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 2,
   "text": "It gave me sixteen metals, three schools of sorcery, a currency made of souls, and a map of rules so detailed it could have been torn out of a fantasy appendix.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s02.mp3",
   "duration": 10.8,
   "cost_usd": 0.048,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 3,
   "text": "I stared at it.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s03.mp3",
   "duration": 1.52,
   "cost_usd": 0.0045,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 4,
   "text": "It was beautiful.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s04.mp3",
   "duration": 1.44,
   "cost_usd": 0.0051,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "text": "It was also a lie.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s05.mp3",
   "duration": 2.0,
   "cost_usd": 0.0054,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 6,
   "text": "Because here's what a hundred thousand words of AI fantasy taught me: any model can hand you powers.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s06.mp3",
   "duration": 6.4,
   "cost_usd": 0.03,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "text": "Fire, lightning, blood magic, time magic, a magic where people trade years off their lives.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s07.mp3",
   "duration": 7.6,
   "cost_usd": 0.0273,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "text": "The powers are never the problem.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s08.mp3",
   "duration": 1.68,
   "cost_usd": 0.0099,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 9,
   "text": "The problem is what the system costs, who it hurts, and what happens when someone cheats.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s09.mp3",
   "duration": 5.44,
   "cost_usd": 0.0267,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 10,
   "text": "There's an actual name for this.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s10.mp3",
   "duration": 1.76,
   "cost_usd": 0.0096,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 11,
   "text": "Brandon Sanderson, the guy who writes Mistborn, calls it the Second Law of Magic: limitations are more interesting than powers.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s11.mp3",
   "duration": 8.4,
   "cost_usd": 0.0381,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 12,
   "text": "And once I held my AI magic system next to that law, I couldn't unsee it.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s12.mp3",
   "duration": 4.64,
   "cost_usd": 0.0219,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 13,
   "text": "Every rule it wrote was decoration.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s13.mp3",
   "duration": 2.24,
   "cost_usd": 0.0105,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 14,
   "text": "Every limit it listed, it forgot.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s14.mp3",
   "duration": 2.32,
   "cost_usd": 0.0099,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 15,
   "text": "So let me show you what I mean.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s15.mp3",
   "duration": 1.6,
   "cost_usd": 0.0093,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 16,
   "text": "And I promise, this isn't an \"AI is dumb\" video.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s16.mp3",
   "duration": 3.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0144,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 17,
   "text": "It's a \"here's exactly which gears grind\" video.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s1_s17.mp3",
   "duration": 2.88,
   "cost_usd": 0.0144,
   "ok": true
  }
 ],
 "s2": [
  {
   "idx": 18,
   "text": "First, the law itself, because it's genuinely beautiful.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.9,
    "style": 0.45,
    "stability": 0.5,
    "pause_after": 0.35,
    "tag": "open"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s18.mp3",
   "duration": 3.12,
   "cost_usd": 0.0168,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 19,
   "text": "In Mistborn, magic runs on sixteen metals, and you drink them like medicine.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s19.mp3",
   "duration": 5.12,
   "cost_usd": 0.0228,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 20,
   "text": "Want to push metal away from you?",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.9,
    "style": 0.45,
    "stability": 0.5,
    "pause_after": 0.3,
    "tag": "question"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s20.mp3",
   "duration": 1.84,
   "cost_usd": 0.0099,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 21,
   "text": "Burn steel.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s21.mp3",
   "duration": 1.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0033,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 22,
   "text": "But burning has a price.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s22.mp3",
   "duration": 1.52,
   "cost_usd": 0.0072,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 23,
   "text": "The metal runs out, and if you flare it, it runs out faster.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s23.mp3",
   "duration": 3.68,
   "cost_usd": 0.018,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 24,
   "text": "Sanderson even thought about the physics: if you push on something heavy, it doesn't move.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s24.mp3",
   "duration": 5.84,
   "cost_usd": 0.027,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 25,
   "text": "You do.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s25.mp3",
   "duration": 1.04,
   "cost_usd": 0.0021,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 26,
   "text": "The magic doesn't let you win.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s26.mp3",
   "duration": 1.84,
   "cost_usd": 0.009,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 27,
   "text": "It makes you make choices.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s27.mp3",
   "duration": 1.92,
   "cost_usd": 0.0078,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 28,
   "text": "In Warbreaker, magic runs on color.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s28.mp3",
   "duration": 2.72,
   "cost_usd": 0.0105,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 29,
   "text": "Literally.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s29.mp3",
   "duration": 1.52,
   "cost_usd": 0.003,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 30,
   "text": "Every spell drains the color out of the world around you, and there are characters who sold their soul, their Breath, one per person, and now live as hollow shells called Drab.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s30.mp3",
   "duration": 11.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0528,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 31,
   "text": "A Drab feels less.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s31.mp3",
   "duration": 2.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0054,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 32,
   "text": "That's not a power fantasy.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s32.mp3",
   "duration": 1.52,
   "cost_usd": 0.0081,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 33,
   "text": "That's a system where power has a receipt.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s2_s33.mp3",
   "duration": 2.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0126,
   "ok": true
  }
 ],
 "s3": [
  {
   "idx": 34,
   "text": "Now watch what AI does with the same assignment.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.9,
    "style": 0.45,
    "stability": 0.5,
    "pause_after": 0.35,
    "tag": "open"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s34.mp3",
   "duration": 2.88,
   "cost_usd": 0.0144,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 35,
   "text": "I gave it a prompt: fire magic, and the cost is blood.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s35.mp3",
   "duration": 4.0,
   "cost_usd": 0.0162,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 36,
   "text": "On page twelve, it remembers.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s36.mp3",
   "duration": 2.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0087,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 37,
   "text": "Casting costs blood.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s37.mp3",
   "duration": 2.0,
   "cost_usd": 0.006,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 38,
   "text": "By page two hundred and forty-seven, the hero is throwing fireballs like confetti, and the bill never arrives.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s38.mp3",
   "duration": 6.72,
   "cost_usd": 0.033,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 39,
   "text": "Sudowrite, an AI writing tool, put it brutally: \"You decided fire magic costs blood on page 12. By page 247, your protagonist is throwing fireballs like confetti at a parade. No blood. No cost. No consequences.\"",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s39.mp3",
   "duration": 17.52,
   "cost_usd": 0.0633,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 40,
   "text": "Why?",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.9,
    "style": 0.45,
    "stability": 0.5,
    "pause_after": 0.3,
    "tag": "question"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s40.mp3",
   "duration": 1.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0012,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 41,
   "text": "Because of something called context drift.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s41.mp3",
   "duration": 2.64,
   "cost_usd": 0.0126,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 42,
   "text": "Researchers at Microsoft and SUTD built a benchmark called Lost in Stories, and it measured exactly when AI breaks its own world rules.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s42.mp3",
   "duration": 9.28,
   "cost_usd": 0.0405,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 43,
   "text": "Facts the story establishes at the twenty-four percent mark get contradicted at the thirty-nine percent mark.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s43.mp3",
   "duration": 6.56,
   "cost_usd": 0.0327,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 44,
   "text": "Twenty-three percent of a story later, the rules start lying.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s44.mp3",
   "duration": 3.68,
   "cost_usd": 0.0183,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 45,
   "text": "And there's an older result that explains it: a model remembers the beginning and end of its context really well, above ninety percent, but in the middle, recall drops to fifty or seventy percent.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s3_s45.mp3",
   "duration": 12.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0588,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 46,
   "text": "Your magic system lives in the middle.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
