   "duration": 2.72,
   "cost_usd": 0.0129,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 51,
   "text": "In Mistborn, atium lets you see a few seconds into the future.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s51.mp3",
   "duration": 3.68,
   "cost_usd": 0.0186,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 52,
   "text": "It's the most expensive thing in the empire, and a piece burns in about thirty seconds.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s52.mp3",
   "duration": 5.04,
   "cost_usd": 0.0261,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 53,
   "text": "And if two people burn atium at the same time, their futures cancel out.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s53.mp3",
   "duration": 4.4,
   "cost_usd": 0.0216,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 54,
   "text": "There's a counterplay baked into the god metal itself.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s54.mp3",
   "duration": 2.8,
   "cost_usd": 0.0162,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 55,
   "text": "Even pewter, the simplest metal, has a crash: burn it to ignore wounds, and when it runs out, every injury you suppressed hits you at once.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s55.mp3",
   "duration": 10.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0417,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 56,
   "text": "Thugs die from wounds they forgot they had.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s56.mp3",
   "duration": 2.48,
   "cost_usd": 0.0129,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 57,
   "text": "Now ask AI for a weakness.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s57.mp3",
   "duration": 2.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0078,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 58,
   "text": "It'll write you a paragraph about how the magic is draining, or forbidden.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s58.mp3",
   "duration": 4.0,
   "cost_usd": 0.0222,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 59,
   "text": "But no enemy ever exploits it, because the enemy doesn't know it either.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s4_s59.mp3",
   "duration": 4.4,
   "cost_usd": 0.0216,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
