   "duration": 4.32,
   "cost_usd": 0.0246,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 64,
   "text": "In Elantris, magic is drawn as symbols called Aons, and they're maps of the land.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s5_s64.mp3",
   "duration": 5.6,
   "cost_usd": 0.0243,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 65,
   "text": "One earthquake added a chasm to the country, and every spell in the world stopped working, for ten years.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s5_s65.mp3",
   "duration": 6.4,
   "cost_usd": 0.0315,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 66,
   "text": "And the closer you are to the source city, the stronger the magic.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s5_s66.mp3",
   "duration": 3.28,
   "cost_usd": 0.0198,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 67,
   "text": "A master can do what a novice can't.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s5_s67.mp3",
   "duration": 2.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.0108,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 68,
   "text": "Now look at AI's characters.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s5_s68.mp3",
   "duration": 1.92,
   "cost_usd": 0.0084,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 69,
   "text": "The farm boy, the old scholar, the street thief, they all cast at exactly the same level.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s5_s69.mp3",
   "duration": 5.92,
   "cost_usd": 0.0267,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 70,
   "text": "Because the model doesn't have a voice for skill.",
