   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s6_s79.mp3",
   "duration": 1.44,
   "cost_usd": 0.0033,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 80,
   "text": "I've watched its characters break their own rules and nothing happens.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s6_s80.mp3",
   "duration": 4.48,
   "cost_usd": 0.021,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 81,
   "text": "No backlash, no dead spren, no price.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s6_s81.mp3",
   "duration": 3.76,
   "cost_usd": 0.0111,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 82,
   "text": "The scene just moves on.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s6_s82.mp3",
   "duration": 1.52,
   "cost_usd": 0.0072,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 83,
   "text": "Because the model is trained to resolve tension, not to let a broken oath sit on the table and burn.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s6_s83.mp3",
   "duration": 5.76,
   "cost_usd": 0.03,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 84,
   "text": "Fifth: scarcity.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s6_s84.mp3",
   "duration": 2.0,
   "cost_usd": 0.0048,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 85,
   "text": "The best systems are gated by logistics.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
