   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s93.mp3",
   "duration": 3.6,
   "cost_usd": 0.0195,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 94,
   "text": "Those five dimensions, cost, weakness, skill, contract, scarcity, aren't five random failures.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s94.mp3",
   "duration": 8.24,
   "cost_usd": 0.0282,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 95,
   "text": "They're five things a language model structurally cannot hold.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s95.mp3",
   "duration": 3.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0186,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 96,
   "text": "Cost needs memory of page twelve.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s96.mp3",
   "duration": 2.08,
   "cost_usd": 0.0099,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 97,
   "text": "Weakness needs a persistent state that survives the scene.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s97.mp3",
   "duration": 3.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0174,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 98,
   "text": "Skill needs differentiated voices, and the model has one voice.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s98.mp3",
   "duration": 3.92,
   "cost_usd": 0.0189,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 99,
   "text": "Contract needs consequences, and it's trained to smooth everything over.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s99.mp3",
   "duration": 4.4,
   "cost_usd": 0.0216,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 100,
   "text": "Scarcity needs restraint, and restraint is the exact opposite of helpful.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s100.mp3",
   "duration": 4.56,
   "cost_usd": 0.0219,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 101,
   "text": "Five gears, and they all grind for the same reason.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s101.mp3",
   "duration": 2.96,
   "cost_usd": 0.0153,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 102,
   "text": "It was never a prompt problem.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s102.mp3",
   "duration": 2.16,
   "cost_usd": 0.009,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 103,
   "text": "No prompt is going to give a model a spine.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s7_s103.mp3",
   "duration": 2.32,
   "cost_usd": 0.0129,
   "ok": true
  }
 ],
 "s8": [
  {
   "idx": 104,
   "text": "Which brings me to the fix, and I want to end on something useful, not just a diagnosis.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.9,
    "style": 0.45,
    "stability": 0.5,
    "pause_after": 0.35,
    "tag": "open"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s104.mp3",
   "duration": 5.36,
   "cost_usd": 0.0264,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 105,
   "text": "The community already found the workaround, even if nobody framed it this way.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s105.mp3",
   "duration": 4.32,
   "cost_usd": 0.0234,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 106,
   "text": "People say AI novels start lying to themselves around chapter fifteen or twenty.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s106.mp3",
   "duration": 5.28,
   "cost_usd": 0.024,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 107,
   "text": "And the fix they keep landing on is a story bible: a document outside the story that holds every rule, every cost, every dead character, and checking the output against it, scene by scene.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s107.mp3",
   "duration": 12.72,
   "cost_usd": 0.0564,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 108,
   "text": "That's not a hack.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.85,
    "style": 0.55,
    "stability": 0.45,
    "pause_after": 0.55,
    "tag": "punch"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s108.mp3",
   "duration": 1.28,
   "cost_usd": 0.0054,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 109,
   "text": "That's the Second Law, enforced from the outside, because the model can't enforce it from the inside.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s109.mp3",
   "duration": 5.68,
   "cost_usd": 0.0303,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 110,
   "text": "So next time an AI hands you a beautiful magic system with sixteen metals and a currency of souls, count the limitations.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s110.mp3",
   "duration": 7.84,
   "cost_usd": 0.0363,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 111,
   "text": "Ask what it costs, who can use it, what happens when someone cheats, and where the fuel comes from.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s111.mp3",
   "duration": 6.56,
   "cost_usd": 0.0297,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 112,
   "text": "If the answers are \"nothing, everyone, nothing, and anywhere,\" you're not holding a magic system.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s112.mp3",
   "duration": 6.72,
   "cost_usd": 0.0291,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 113,
   "text": "You're holding a special effect.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s113.mp3",
   "duration": 1.76,
   "cost_usd": 0.0096,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 114,
   "text": "Sanderson spent a career proving the difference.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
    "pause_after": 0.12,
    "tag": "norm"
   },
   "path": "C:\\DevWork\\social-media\\openmontage\\projects\\sanderson-laws\\assets\\audio\\sentences\\s8_s114.mp3",
   "duration": 2.48,
   "cost_usd": 0.0144,
   "ok": true
  },
  {
   "idx": 115,
   "text": "And now, for the first time, we get to watch a machine fail the same test, in the same five places, every single time.",
   "params": {
    "speed": 0.95,
    "style": 0.3,
    "stability": 0.6,
